    "created_at": "2016-04-12T20:57:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-12T21:00:56Z",
    "body": "@laukstein : fyi, your \"browsers status\" comment here is actually orthogonal to the main thing this bug is about.\n\nYour bug links there are for browsers supporting SVG images as favicons (`rel=\"icon\"`).  But this github-issue is about is about using an SVG mask (plus a color) _instead_ of a favicon (`rel=\"mask-icon\"`).  Which is completely different, from a spec & an implementation perspective.\n\n(I'd suggest either removing that github-comment (since it's not directly relevant to this issue), or editing it to clarify what those bug links are about (standard svg favicons, not mask-icon).)\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
